      "extract": "[]{#concluding label=\"concluding\"} In this article we considered several conjectures and identities that first appeared in [@M1]. Identities (6.7), (6.10), (6.12) and (6.13) from [@M1] are proved using the Jacobi Triple Product identity in [@KMR]. We generalized these identities and gave both analytic and combinatorial proofs. Considerations of similar identities from [@M1], and their proofs in [@KMR] led us to",
